    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok that makes sense. so basically they are just a middleman so no one gets scammed. but is it like... safe? i mean, if they're just holding all this cash and sensitive info, what's stopping them from just making a mistake or something? it feels a bit weird having a random company just sitting on a huge pile of money for weeks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
