      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Escrow agents are indeed regulated and licensed professionals, and they follow strict guidelines and industry standards to ensure safe and secure handling of funds. These precautions may include insurance, audits, and compliance with state and federal regulations, providing an added layer of protection. Additionally, escrow accounts are typically segregated from the agent's other funds and bank accounts, minimizing the risk of theft or mismanagement.",
      "source": "target",
