    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the regulation part, but it's still a lot of pressure on one person or one small office to just... sit there with all that wealth. it feels like they have to be super careful not to let anything go wrong, like they're guarding a hoard or something. is there anything specific they do to keep things organized so it doesn't just get messy or chaotic?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
